  m_text: "USER LEVELS\nUser Levels are custom levels that you can create, edit,
    and share with others!\n\nHOW TO CREATE / EDIT?\nCreating / editing of user levels
    is explained in UserLevelManual You can download it by \"Get Manual\", it will
    appear in Documents/GetNuts \n\nIMPORT / EXPORT LEVELS\nSelect a level you want
    to import / export.\nImport -> Choose a file from your drive to rewrite selected
    level\nExport -> Export selected level to Documents/GetNuts\nExport All -> Export
    all levels to Documents/GetNuts"
